        "item_6rGiW6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "product safety",
            "content": "<p>Nothing is more important to us than your baby’s safety. That’s why we have invested in ensuring that our products meet or exceed regulatory standards encompassing food contact, chemical composition, bite and tear resistance, and other aspects of safety. </p><p>We work with leading global safety testing labs to certify that each component of our products is safe. Our products are free of BPA, lead, phthalates, and cadmium. They exceed the mechanical strength requirements of the Consumer Product Safety Improvement Act for children up to 36 months old.  They even meet the chemical and mechanical strength requirements of Europe’s rigorous EN14350 regulation.</p><p>The ink on our glass bottles is now tested for lead separately from the glass.  Our third party testing lab has found no detectable level of lead in the ink or the glass.</p><p>See the <a href=\"/pages/faq#safety\" title=\"/pages/faq#safety\">product safety section</a> of our faq for important information on safe use of our products.</p>",
            "custom-html": ""
