            "custom-html": "<p>We accept returns and exchanges of new, unopened, unused, resalable products for 30 days after the original order date, subject to a 10% restocking fee.  Shipping charges are nonrefundable.  Customer is responsible for return shipping costs.  We will provide a shipping label using our discounted shipping rates.\n</p><p>\nTo help ensure the safety of every baby, we never sell products that have been opened or previously used, therefore we cannot accept returns of products that have been opened or whose packaging seal has been removed. \n</p><p>From time to time we may offer \"happiness guarantee\" promotions.  The details of such promotions are provided at the time of such promotions.  Products sold under certain promotions such as close-out sales or deeply discounted offers may not be eligible for return.  Please read the terms and conditions of any such promotion to determine return eligibility.  </p><p>Products sold under our \"2 for $35\" promotion beginning in March 2025 are not eligible for return or the happiness guarantee program; all sales are final.</p><p>In all cases we will replace products that are damaged or defective if we are notified within 30 days of order placement.  </p><p>Additional terms and conditions apply.  See the <a href=\"https://momi-baby.myshopify.com/pages/faq#purchasing\">purchasing section</a> of our faq for more details.</p>"
